FILE: vUX-domDrawer.js
FEATURE: sketch-pad-module
DATE: 2026-10-06
PRIOR STATE: as committed in 3f1472a (destroy() added)

REASON
DELETED. Replaced by SketchPad.

DOMDrawer drew one rectangle by stretching an absolutely-positioned <div>. Its
only consumer was the My Invitees card tool. Problems found on inspection:
mouse events only, so no touch; getPoints() measured the first element with
the class instead of the event target, so a second drawing surface drew at
the wrong offset; enableDrawing() looked for an already-drawn item, so
enabling did nothing visible before the first draw; release() left
states.enabled true; the getDrawnPoints getter was an empty stub returning
undefined; and several error messages named the wrong property.

The design could not grow to other shapes. SketchPad's rect tool with
config.tools = ["select", "rect"], config.maxElements = 1 and config.bounded
covers DOMDrawer's use and adds move, resize, delete, undo and touch. My
Invitees was migrated in the same change.
